- **Plan:** firstmate's Planner home `data/plans/english-lazy-plan/plan.html`. Decisions Q1-Q5 (firstmate 108) and Q6-Q7 (firstmate 109); the captain said go on 2026-10-24.
- **Related:** #1575, #1576, #1577 (P3); #1519 and #1598 (Web Push); #1544 (Study proof boundary).
