- **E10 scope:** in this ticket, E10 covers only the rows of E1-E6 and E8. E7's rows stay with #1575.

## Stop lines

- Storing any part of a sent message, or a name, ticket id or company term, in any row (`nearWords` and `oppositeWord` included).
- Uploading, storing or logging his voice take (E13).
- Changing an official page row before its draft passes, or deleting or renaming a row while a 5001 deploy runs.
- Screenshotting a company-profile page or the admin menu.
- Any tap on the K50 other than by the owner; E1 and E8's real take are the owner's.
- Building P3 here, or any scoring outside the local GPU model.

## Blocked by

None to start the code.
- **E1 and E4** are proven only after the Web Push verification of #1519 / #1598 (PR 1561, 1601, 1605; verification pending).
- **E8's Friday offer** is proven only after `data/pron-study-build/verify.md` passes. Until then E8 proves the "unverified keeps the normal card" half and stays open.

